  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"268417aa-9fc3-49d2-973e-d92dac80d8a3\">\n  <p><strong><em>There was a man sent from God<br>whose name was John.</em></strong></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><em>He was a burning and a shining light.<br>....filled with the Holy Ghost, from the womb.<br>....none greater, born of women.<br>....the voice of one crying in the wilderness.<br>....in the deserts, till the day of his shewing.<br>....the prophet of the Highest.</em></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><em>He went before the face of the Lord<br>To turn the hearts of the Fathers.</em></p>\n  <p class=\"poem\"><em>He said, Behold the Lamb of God.<br>....Make straight in the desert,<br>a highway for our God.<br>....Repent ye.</em></p>\n</article>\n",
